			<div class="content" id="post-content-2714236">
									

<p>Humans aren't immune to its effects because they're stronger than it. They specifically aren't affected by it because their evolutionary innate fear of it is being suppressed by our frontal cortices. As such, it preys upon us specifically. But someone with an altered brain structure - like Phineas Gage, whos frontal cortex was destroyed, or someone with sufficiently severe anxiety/paranoia&#8230; their amygdala is able to send that &quot;GTFO&quot; signal. It's survived for so long on a human-only diet because humans like to send large parties after scary monsters. Whoops.</p>
<p>All the animals are trying to warn the humans in order to starve it and allow them to live in safety.</p>

